sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor You
    participant AI as AI client
    participant MCP as MCP tools
    participant QB as qBittorrent
    participant CLI as prowl CLI
    participant Srv as Media server
    participant JF as Jellyfin
    You->>AI: "Get this release"
    AI->>MCP: search_torrents
    MCP-->>AI: ranked releases
    You->>AI: pick one
    AI->>MCP: add_torrent(kind, folder)
    MCP->>QB: add, stopped at metadata
    MCP->>MCP: check file names
    MCP->>QB: start (verdict ok)
    MCP-->>AI: verdict + file tree + job queued
    AI->>CLI: wait (background task)
    CLI->>QB: poll progress
    CLI-->>AI: exit 0, download finished
    AI->>CLI: deliver --until subtitled (background)
    CLI-->>AI: per-episode subtitle report
    AI->>CLI: deliver (background)
    CLI->>Srv: rsync, never overwrite
    CLI->>Srv: SHA-256 compare
    CLI->>JF: scan, wait, check videos listed
    CLI-->>AI: delivered
    AI->>You: report, ask before removing local data
    You->>AI: yes
    AI->>MCP: remove_torrent(delete_files)
